Well, choking is a major problem so your god will fix it as long as
you're "allowed" to (prayer timeout is up, god not angry etc).  Or you
could try to kill the golem before it chokes you, but this is best
done only if you know for sure that it's almost dead, or if you have a
stethoscope or something so you can check.  Engraving Elbereth makes
it let go (I think).  Putting it to sleep or paralysing it might also
work - I've never actually tried that.  Or you could use the
traditional methods of escape - WoDigging, Teleport...

You know, what I love about Nethack is the sheer number of ways to get
out of a nasty situation.  It's just that you never remember in time
